{'symbol': 'BEN', 'date': '2023-02-13 16:00:00', 'title': 'FRANKLIN TEMPLETON NAMES LEEOR P. AVIGDOR AS SVP, GLOBAL TREASURER AND HEAD OF M&A', 'text': "SAN MATEO, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FRANKLIN RESOURCES, INC. [NYSE:BEN], A GLOBAL INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT ORGANIZATION OPERATING AS FRANKLIN TEMPLETON, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF LEEOR P. AVIGDOR AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, GLOBAL TREASURER AND HEAD OF M&A. AVIGDOR WILL CONTINUE TO BE BASED IN FRANKLIN TEMPLETON'S NEW YORK OFFICE AND WILL REPORT TO MATTHEW NICHOLLS, EVP, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER."}